<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Recoil Reduction</Major>
    <Description>New updated recoil script.

Resolution 1680x1050 any 16:10 ration will work, or stretch res

Shakes screen miniumly to cut back on visual interference, while still providing enough recoil reduction to be effective.

NOTE: R99 and CAR have ridiculous recoil patterns, for these two weapons, YOU STILL NEED TO CONTROL SOME VERTICAL RECOIL. It's not perfect but its 80% easier, you shouldnt be trying to beam someone from 30m w a r99 or car regardless. Any AR or LMG will essentially have zero recoil, devo and havoc have some intial but none you cant handle. Good luck!

Tip: Higher mag scopes amplify the effect, lower one do the opposite, not to a major degree but noticeable. Also dont be that guy and beam someone across the map with a 4x havoc, just looks suscpious. use a 301 or lmg. dont get reported

Going to release another one with different patterns, stay tuned, happy macroing!</Description>
    <Comment>micro cross/circle pattern - increased vertical, 1ms delay</Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>1</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>LeftDown 1
MoveR 1 0
Delay 1 ms
MoveR 1 0
Delay 0 ms
MoveR 1 0
Delay 1 ms
MoveR 0 2
Delay 0 ms
MoveR 0 2
Delay 1 ms
MoveR 0 2
Delay 0 ms
MoveR -1 0
Delay 1 ms
MoveR -1 0
Delay 0 ms
MoveR -1 0
Delay 1 ms
MoveR 0 -2
Delay 0 ms
Delay 1 ms
MoveR 0 -2
Delay 0 ms
MoveR 0 -2
Goto 2</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Apex Legends</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>